! conclusion: This is a problem-stating node: without an activity ledger, the AI4CI request can look speculative or infrastructure-heavy.
  + context: Minted as a marked self-derived fallback after A5's external-first search found no project statement of this specific problem.
  + IF:
    A small research request must make its uses auditable.
  + HOWEVER:
    The problem, verbatim from the source pattern: “Without a clear ledger of what the budget buys in terms of specific activities (specialist annotation, light AI usage, seminar facilitation), the request can look speculative or infrastructure-heavy.” (source: futon3 library/ai4ci/funding-justification.flexiarg:26-28)
  + THEN:
    Treat this node as the landing point for budget-justification mechanisms.
  + BECAUSE:
    The source class makes the circular provenance mechanically visible.
